{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"722","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"永續投資重視度 台灣落後亞洲","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019-10-09 14:37:59</span>聯合晚報 記者張瀞文／台北報導</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">調查顯示，亞洲投資人重視永續投資，尤其是印度、中國及印尼。台灣投資人重視永續投資程度雖落後亞洲平均值，但仍高於歐洲。而且，出乎意料之外的是，最重視永續投資的是<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">X</span>世代（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">38-50</span>歲），而非千禧世代（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">18-37</span>歲）。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019</span>施羅德全球投資人大調查顯示，進行投資選擇時，全球有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">57%</span>的投資人會考量永續性，亞洲投資人的比例更高達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">66%</span>，台灣的比例為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">59%</span>，略高於全球平均與歐洲的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">51%</span>，但低於亞洲平均。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">施羅德全球投資人大調查為施羅德投資集團自<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2016</span>年開始的調查，每年針對全球<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">32</span>個國家、超過<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2.2</span>萬名投資人進行調查。調查議題涵蓋投資人行為、退休、永續投資等議題。永續投資不僅考量投資標的的營收、獲利等財務因素，而是會挑選重視環境、社會、企業治理（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">ESG</span>）的企業，期望在達成投資報酬目標時，也能為社會帶來更多正向影響。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">從過去三年的調查中也看到，新興國家對永續投資的重視程度一直優於成熟國家，新興亞洲尤甚。施羅德投資集團全球官方機構及思維領導主管拉爾斯登（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Gavin Ralston</span>）分析，或許在亞洲有更多關於氣候破壞或社會性議題的新聞事件，使人們覺得他們正在面對相關威脅。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">三年來，調查中最重視永續投資的國家幾乎都落在亞洲，以印度占<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">73%</span>最高，其次是中國的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">66%</span>、印尼的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">62%</span>。台灣則處在亞洲的中段班，重視永續投資程度在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2017</span>年為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">75%</span>，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2018</span>年雖提升到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">83%</span>，但今年則落到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">59%</span>。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">當被問及是否想要進行永續投資時，亞洲國家中日本的投入程度只有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">26%</span>，明顯低於其他國家，更與印度的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">73%</span>形成鮮明對比。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">資料來源：<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">https://fund.udn.com/fund/story/5858/4094628</span></span></p>\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2019-10-09","clk_count":"201"}},"__N_SSG":true}